{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a11f28e842b0399df8e8b918382694c6.poster.avif?t=1764172547\" width=780 height=780 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a11f28e842b0399df8e8b918382694c6.webm?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a11f28e842b0399df8e8b918382694c6.mp4?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the mostly unseen hands behind some of your favorite games (or not\u2026 we honestly have no idea\u2026 but seriously, we\u2019ve got the NDAs to prove we worked on some cool stuff), comes a debut that refuses to stay in the shadows (we need to eat).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fading Echo is a fast-paced elemental action-adventure RPG set in the scorched, floating isles of Corel. You play as One, a young Legend with a tangled past and a dangerously short timeline. Her mission? Stop the Paradox Corruption before the world vanishes under its grip. Armed with \u00c6theric powers and a knack for turning water into destruction, you\u2019ll slide, shift, and smash your way through surreal realities to defy oblivion and rewrite your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3b1f60dbb2c2042fbfd7e6d56937ec7b.poster.avif?t=1764172547\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3b1f60dbb2c2042fbfd7e6d56937ec7b.webm?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3b1f60dbb2c2042fbfd7e6d56937ec7b.mp4?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE WATER, BUT DEADLIER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liquify. Evaporate. Detonate. Shift between human and fluid form to navigate impossible terrain, solve elemental puzzles, and weaponize the world around you. Slip through cracks, burst through pipes, crash from the sky. Creativity isn\u2019t optional\u2026 it\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/966c825e6291899344cbf97b418255e1.poster.avif?t=1764172547\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/966c825e6291899344cbf97b418255e1.webm?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/966c825e6291899344cbf97b418255e1.mp4?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REACT TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corel doesn\u2019t play nice. Mix water, lava, toxic goo, corruption itself (or whatever else you can find) into chain reactions that drench, conduct, solidify, and ruin your enemies\u2019 day. Everything reacts dynamically. Everything matters. Everything breaks if you push hard enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/820406f05f1117e68019dade7e5823fc.poster.avif?t=1764172547\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/820406f05f1117e68019dade7e5823fc.webm?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/820406f05f1117e68019dade7e5823fc.mp4?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE WORLD, IF YOU MUST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just here to make things go boom (though you\u2019ll do plenty of that). Shape \u00c6ther into high-impact combat styles, blend tactics with raw force, and fight back against the forces unraveling your home. Sometimes with honor. Sometimes with attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/709bd5cc11d33070ee51bacf193ba35c.poster.avif?t=1764172547\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/709bd5cc11d33070ee51bacf193ba35c.webm?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/709bd5cc11d33070ee51bacf193ba35c.mp4?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEY\u2019RE NOT FRIENDS, THEY\u2019RE LEGENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may fight alone, but you're never without baggage. Meet your crew of misfit allies and your nemesis, each drawn to you by guilt, loyalty, or questionable life choices. Their stories might just save you\u2026 or make everything worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring an all-star cast including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samantha B\u00e9art as\u00a0<i>One</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matthew Mercer as... nooo we don't want to spoil this one for now!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laura Bailey as\u00a0<i>Vellum</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jasmine Bhullar as\u00a0<i>Rahne</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and more voices inbound.\u00a0<i>Bob</i>\u00a0and\u00a0<i>Cayrn</i>\u00a0have things to say, we just can't tell you who they are. Yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AGE RATING? IT\u2019S COMPLICATED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re probably somewhere between 12+ if your parents are cool and 16+ if they\u2019re not. Expect stylized action, irreverent language, emotional gut punches, and a world that\u2019s slowly dying. There\u2019s also Bob. So\u2026 probably not E for Everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fading Echo blends creative elemental combat, surreal traversal, and a beautifully broken world full of secrets, consequences, and Legends in the making.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2467880?t=1764172547","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2467880?t=1764172547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/50aff42020f189e2205325c7ad936af99203af9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764172547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/50aff42020f189e2205325c7ad936af99203af9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764172547","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a11f28e842b0399df8e8b918382694c6.poster.avif?t=1764172547\" width=78