E WORLD, IF YOU MUST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just here to make things go boom (though you\u2019ll do plenty of that). Shape \u00c6ther into high-impact combat styles, blend tactics with raw force, and fight back against the forces unraveling your home. Sometimes with honor. Sometimes with attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/709bd5cc11d33070ee51bacf193ba35c.poster.avif?t=1764172547\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/709bd5cc11d33070ee51bacf193ba35c.webm?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/709bd5cc11d33070ee51bacf193ba35c.mp4?t=1764172547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEY\u2019RE NOT FRIENDS, THEY\u2019RE LEGENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may fight alone, but you're never without baggage. Meet your crew of misfit allies and your nemesis, each drawn to you by guilt, loyalty, or questionable life choices. Their stories might just save you\u2026 or make everything worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring an all-star cast including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samantha B\u00e9art as\u00a0<i>One</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matthew Mercer as... nooo we don't want to spoil this one for now!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laura Bailey as\u00a0<i>Vellum</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jasmine Bhullar as\u00a0<i>Rahne</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and more voices inbound.\u00a0<i>Bob</i>\u00a0and\u00a0<i>Cayrn</i>\u00a0have things to say, we just can't tell you who they are. Yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AGE RATING? IT\u2019S COMPLICATED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re probably somewhere between 12+ if your parents are cool and 16+ if they\u2019re not. Expect stylized action, irreverent language, emotional gut punches, and a world that\u2019s slowly dying. There\u2019s also Bob. So\u2026 probably not E for Everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fading Echo blends creative elemental combat, surreal traversal, and a beautifully broken world full of secrets, consequences, and Legends in the making.</p>","developers":["New Tales","Emeteria"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/d869721615c02af8b3ed292293c5275de109c93a/header.jpg?t=1764172547","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 New Tales 2025 \u2013 All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2467880/215058713/30d62663b7617579b1c18d11d82d96e65cb758c6/1759158869/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759160683","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2467880/215058713/30d62663b7617579b1c18d11d82d96e65cb758c6/1759158869/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759160683","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2467880/215058713/30d62663b7617579b1c18d11d82d96e65cb758c6/1759158869/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759160683","id":257208651,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208651/f64190178ca17b6b61be71e2bbf8db7070a5d83e/movie_600x